<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Exam Question Categories</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #fff1f4;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: auto;
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 18px;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #b73561;
        }

        .category {
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: #ffe8ee;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #b73561;
        }

        .marks {
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <h1>📝 Exam Question Categories</h1>

    <div class="category">
        <h2>1 Mark Questions</h2>
        <p>Usually require short definitions, terms or direct answers.</p>
        <p class="marks">Focus: Key concepts</p>
    </div>

    <div class="category">
        <h2>2 Mark Questions</h2>
        <p>Usually require a short explanation with important points.</p>
        <p class="marks">Focus: Understanding</p>
    </div>

    <div class="category">
        <h2>3–4 Mark Questions</h2>
        <p>Usually require explanations, examples or multiple points.</p>
        <p class="marks">Focus: Detailed concepts</p>
    </div>

    <div class="category">
        <h2>Long Answer Questions</h2>
        <p>Require structured explanations, diagrams, examples or comparisons.</p>
        <p class="marks">Focus: Complete understanding</p>
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
